CON-11: read a pollutant in a treatment equation by that equation's type

applyNodeTreatment() built one array of what each bare pollutant name reads,
choosing the inflow concentration when the REFERENCED pollutant had a
removal-type equation and the node concentration otherwise, and used it for
every equation at the node. The manual (section 5.4.2) defines it by the
equation being evaluated. Fill the array with node concentrations and pass
the inflow concentrations instead when the evaluated equation is R =.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply CON-11_swmm600.patch

